# Copy to .env.local (gitignored) to enable the sync engine.
#
# VITE_NEON_DSN — the same Neon connection string as ../.env.local's
# NEON_DSN. Bundled into the built app at compile time (Vite inlines
# VITE_-prefixed vars), which is acceptable here only because this is a
# single-operator app you build and run yourself — never distribute a build
# with this baked in to anyone else.
VITE_NEON_DSN=

# VITE_USER_ID — your account's id from public.users. Printed when you ran
# ../scripts/create-user.mjs; if you don't have it handy:
#   NEON_DSN="..." node ../scripts/whoami.mjs you@example.com
VITE_USER_ID=

# VITE_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY — optional. Get one at https://console.anthropic.com.
# Enables periodic-screenshot session summarization while the timer runs
# (see src/ai/session-summary.ts): every 5 minutes, a screenshot is
# described by Claude and immediately discarded — only the description is
# kept — and at Stop the descriptions are combined into a draft work-log
# note you review before saving. Leave blank to skip screen capture
# entirely; the timer works fine without it. Same single-operator caveat as
# VITE_NEON_DSN above: this key is bundled into the built app, acceptable
# only because you build and run this yourself.
VITE_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
